ll:meta key="artists" value="東雲 彰人"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="東雲彰人"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="しののめ あきと"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="シノノメ アキト"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Shinonome Akito"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="东云彰人"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="시노노메 아키토"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="青柳 冬弥"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="青柳冬弥"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="あおやぎ とうや"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="アオヤギ トウヤ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Aoyagi Touya"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="青柳冬彌"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="아오야기 토우야"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Vivid BAD SQUAD"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ビビッドバッドスクワッド"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Bibiddo Baddo Sukuwaddo"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="炫狂小队"/><amll:meta key="album" value="RAD DOGS/シネマ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="RAD DOGS/シネマ - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="RAD DOGS / Cinema - Single"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1894065144"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001UVj3I3OS3xH"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="332293152"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="3o1jGwcxZQ8jmNeOyirvTb"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1594806617"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPX302136190"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="68000793"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ranhengzhang"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en"><text for="L1">Suddenly, everyone started up</text><text for="L2">Onto a nonsensical scenario</text><text for="L3">This is just like a movie</text><text for="L4">Exactly like a movie</text><text for="L5">No matter where you go, there&apos;s a story</text><text for="L6">This path I&apos;m traveling is riddled with countless mistakes</text><text for="L7">How many are there to be circled out?</text><text for="L8">What&apos;s bad about that?</text><text for="L9">Is there anything bad about that?</text><text for="L10">If there is, go on and tell me</text><text for="L11">Of dawn</text><text for="L12">A delusion</text><text for="L13">Invaluable escapades and</text><text for="L14">A misunderstood hero play-pretend</text><text for="L15">Traffic&apos;s already jammed up now-</text><text for="L16">Oh well, nothing I can do about that anyway</text><text for="L17">&quot;It wasn&apos;t supposed to be like this&quot;</text><text for="L18">&quot;What&apos;s it supposed to be like then?&quot;</text><text for="L19">The more I thought about that</text><text for="L20">No, it can&apos;t be this, not this.</text><text for="L21">This is a bad fit for me</text><text for="L22">I&apos;m not suited for it-</text><text for="L23">Should I quit it now, or-</text><text for="L24">But that&apos;s not right, right!</text><text for="L25">I wonder, when will I get to be</text><text for="L26">The leading star of this show?</text><text for="L27">Laughing every time I fall short</text><text for="L28">Crying every time I count my growing baggage</text><text for="L29">Feeling disappointed when things aren&apos;t as I hoped</text><text for="L30">I can&apos;t even blame anyone else, and it bothers me</text><text for="L31">The lights of the brilliant shining city</text><text for="L32">Passing by a defeated expression</text><text for="L33">The time to start is now!</text><text for="L34">Yes, that&apos;s right, let&apos;s try again, again, again...</text><text for="L35">This can&apos;t be right, right.</text><text for="L36">This is a bad fit for me</text><text for="L37">I&apos;m not suited for it-</text><text for="L38">I could stop now but-</text><text for="L39">It kept repeating thousands of times</text><text for="L40">I&apos;ll just keep hoping for tomorrow</text><text for="L41">Of dawn</text><text for="L42">A delusion</text><text for="L43">Invaluable escapades and</text><text for="L44">A misunderstood hero play-pretend</text><text for="L45">Traffic&apos;s already jammed up now-</text><text for="L46">Oh well, nothing I can do about that anyway</text><text for="L47">Back then, I&apos;m sure it was there,</text><text for="L48">Something I drew up was there</text><text for="L49">When was it that I...?</text><text for="L50">Suddenly everyone started up</text><text for="L51">Onto a nonsense scenario</text><text for="L52">What are you playing at?</text><text for="L53">Who are you trying to be?</text><text for="L54">There&apos;s no way you could be that, right?</text><text for="L55">It&apos;s not enough...</text><text for="L56">We&apos;re not here yet, yet.</text><text for="L57">This can&apos;t be the end, so</text><text for="L58">If you&apos;re not suited for the role</text><text for="L59">Then just rewrite the script!</text><text for="L60">Look, for the most part</text><text for="L61">I&apos;m sure it&apos;ll always just be me</text><text for="L62">The leading star will only be me!</text><text for="L63">Someday it&apos;ll be bye-bye</text><text for="L64">When the end comes</text><text for="L65">Smile for the curtain call</text><text for="L66">And the applause</text><text for="L67">The future I wanted to change has come</text><text for="L68">Whatever you like, however you like it,</text><text for="L69">This is it</text><text for="L70">I made it here, all the way from the bottom</text><text for="L71">Just like a movie, this is my story</text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">每个人都猝不及防地开了场</text><text for="L2">在荒唐潦草的剧本之上</text><text for="L3">这像是一部电影</text><text for="L4">简直就像一部电影</text><text for="L5">随处可见的平凡故事</text><text for="L6">满是错误的一条来路</text><text for="L7">能被肯定的又有几处</text><text for="L8">到底哪里不好呢</text><text for="L9">究竟是何处不好</text><text for="L10">至少告诉我这些吧</text><text for="L11">破晓时分的</text><text for="L13">珍贵的逃避之旅</text><text for="L14">自以为是英雄的游戏</text><text for="L15">早已停滞不前了</text><text for="L16">束手无策无可奈何了吧</text><text for="L17">“本不该是这样的吧”</text><text for="L18">“那又本该是怎样呢”</text><text for="L19">越是去想就越发深陷</text><text for="L20">不对 全都错了</text><text for="L21">格格不入对吧</text><text for="L22">毫不适合</text><text for="L23">要现在就放弃吗</text><text for="L24">那也太离谱</text><text for="L25">究竟要到哪一天我</text><text for="L26">才能成为故事的主角呢</text><text for="L27">力不从心时就笑着</text><text for="L28">数着增多的包袱又哭泣</text><text for="L29">期望不高却还是会失望</text><text for="L30">连责备都做不到徒留烦恼</text><text for="L31">璀璨闪耀的城市灯火</text><text for="L32">带着狼狈神情擦肩而过</text><text for="L33">要开始就趁现在！没错</text><text for="L34">那就再次来过</text><text for="L35">全都错了</text><text for="L36">格格不入对吧</text><text for="L37">毫不适合</text><text for="L38">若现在立刻放弃的话</text><text for="L39">可重复了几万次之后</text><text for="L40">还是会对明天充满期待</text><text for="L41">破晓时分的</text><text for="L43">珍贵的逃避之旅</text><text for="L44">自以为是英雄的游戏</text><text for="L45">早已停滞不前了</text><text for="L46">束手无策无可奈何了吧</text><text for="L47">那时候确实有过一些什么</text><text for="L48">确实描绘出了某些东西</text><text for="L49">不知不觉中我已经</text><text for="L50">每个人都猝不及防地开了场</text><text for="L51">在荒唐潦草的剧本之上</text><text for="L52">是在扮演着什么吗</text><text for="L53">是在扮演着谁吗</text><text for="L54">哪可能有那种事</text><text for="L55">这还不是…</text><text for="L56">这里还不是终点</text><text for="L57">因为还没结束啊</text><text for="L58">毫不适合</text><text for="L59">那就干脆改写了吧</text><text for="L60">你看 说穿了</text><text for="L61">无论何时都一定</text><text for="L62">主角只能是我对吧</text><text for="L63">终有一天说再见</text><text for="L64">因为结局终将到来</text><text for="L65">掌声与喝彩声中</text><text for="L66">带着笑容谢幕告别</text><text for="L67">想要改变的未来就在这里</text><text for="L68">随心所欲自由自在</text><text for="L69">这就对了</text><text for="L70">从最底层一路飞奔而上</text><text for="L71">宛如电影般的故事</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="0.740" end="1.000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">da re</span> <span begin="1.000" end="1.100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mo</span> <span begin="1.100" end="1.340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ga</span> <span begin="1.340" end="1.670" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">to tsu</span> <span 